Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.81,0:00:26.38,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}who was waiting
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.38,0:00:26.71,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.71,0:00:27.03,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}He heard
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.03,0:00:27.85,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}their players say:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.85,0:00:28.32,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}we have
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.32,0:00:28.91,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}to win here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.91,0:00:29.17,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}We can't
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.17,0:00:29.81,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}go to penalties.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.81,0:00:30.45,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}The final went
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.45,0:00:31.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}to extra time,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.24,0:00:32.13,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}still goalless.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.13,0:00:32.66,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}Then, early
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.66,0:00:33.13,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}in the second
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.13,0:00:33.67,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}half of extra
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.67,0:00:33.99,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}time,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.99,0:00:35.37,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}Ferran Torres scored.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.37,0:00:37.06,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}Spain won 1-0.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.06,0:00:38.09,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}Argentina never
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.09,0:00:38.89,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}got their shootout.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.89,0:00:39.49,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}Martinez says
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.49,0:00:40.06,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}one of Spain's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.06,0:00:40.85,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}goalkeepers even
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.85,0:00:41.45,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}told him:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.45,0:00:42.23,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}thank God they
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.23,0:00:43.06,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}won the match.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.06,0:00:43.69,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}And he's sure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.69,0:00:43.89,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}how it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.89,0:00:44.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}would have ended.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.60,0:00:44.84,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}If we
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.84,0:00:45.79,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}had reached penalties,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.79,0:00:46.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}we would have won.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.60,0:00:47.03,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}I felt it
